//? Title: Powerset construction: actual reachable subsets and missing moves
//? Subtitle: Actual canonical histories, retained original fixtures and explicit controls
//? Exports: both
//? Lang: en-GB

\abstract(
A DFA state is the actual set of NFA states reachable after a word. The existing
validated native determinizer already retains these source subsets in discovery
order; this conversion uses that provenance directly. The original
suffix-language NFA generator now lives in the core. It accepts binary words
whose nth symbol from the end is1, providing a precise controlled family with an
exponential number of reachable deterministic states.
)

\toc

> Mechanism and mathematical scope

$$ \Delta(S,a)=\bigcup_{q\in S}\delta(q,a),\qquad S\text{ accepts iff }S\cap F\ne\varnothing. $$

> A tiny actual producing history

The table and native concept diagram read the same producing execution. Every
block below is a complete editable C++ program.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/powerset_construction_tiny.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>
#include <datamunge/plot/plot.hpp>
#include <datamunge/plot/diagram.hpp>
#include <datamunge/algorithms/modular_exponentiation.hpp>
#include <datamunge/algorithms/integer_arithmetic.hpp>
#include <filesystem>
#include <print>
#include <algorithm>
#include <cmath>
#include <limits>
#include <climits>
#include <datamunge/algorithms/number_theory.hpp>
#include <numeric>
#include <numbers>
#include <random>
#include <string>
#include <vector>
#include <map>
#include <set>
#include <array>
#include <tuple>
#include <datamunge/algorithms/prufer.hpp>
#include <datamunge/algorithms/flow_diagram.hpp>
#include <datamunge/algorithms/powerset_examples.hpp>
int main() {
    namespace a = dm::algorithms;
    namespace g = dm::graphics;
    std::filesystem::create_directories("build");

    auto n = a::nth_from_end_nfa(2);
    auto t = a::powerset_construction_trace(n, false, 16);
    std::print("\n| actual DFA id | actual NFA subset | transition0 | transition1 | accepting |\n| ---: | " "--- | ---: | ---: | --- |\n");
    for (int i = 0; i < t.dfa.num_states; ++i)
        std::print("| {} | `{}` | {} | {} | {} |\n", i, t.subsets[i],
                   t.dfa.delta[i][0], t.dfa.delta[i][1], t.dfa.accept[i] != 0);

    g::Diagram d;
    d.node("n0", {0, 0},
           std::format("Actual initial source subset\n{}",
                       t.subsets[t.dfa.start]));
    d.node("n1", {10, 0},
           std::format("Actual state after symbol 1\n{}",
                       t.subsets[t.dfa.delta[t.dfa.start][1]]));
    d.node("n2", {20, 0},
           std::format("Actual reachable DFA states\n{}", t.dfa.num_states));
    d.edge("n0", "n1").edge("n1", "n2");
    d.save_svg("build/powerset_construction_tiny.svg");
}
```
