| policy fixture | actual states | actual start id | actual unions |
| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: |
| empty partial | 0 | -1 | 0 |
| empty complete | 1 | 0 | 1 |
| missing partial | 1 | 0 | 1 |
| missing complete | 2 | 0 | 2 |
Output-state cap checked: true; complete invalid-target guard: true.
